# Local test-run scratch: pytest --basetemp copies, agent debugging dirs, run logs.
# These are regenerated by every run and are not part of the repo; a single full-suite
# run leaves ~300 MB behind, so they must never reach the index.
.tmp*/
.tmp-regression*.log
